## Quick compare

| | Today's Picks | Best Combos |
|--|---------------|-------------|
| Unit | 1 tip | 2–3 tips |
| Scope | One league | All `TODAY_SPORTS` leagues |
| Cap | 6 / league | 18 / league into pool; 48 pool; 3+3 main + mixed |
| Bar | ≥68% / calibrated / wise 70% | Prefer ≥62%; soft-fill ≥55% |
| Ranking | Confidence | Joint × mix × correlation score |

